#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:155
msgid "Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them."
msgstr "您的密钥，由提供商向您收费。它存储在本网站上，且仅发送给他们。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:163
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:164
msgid "Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well."
msgstr "留空则使用能胜任工作的最便宜模型。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:171
msgid "This site is written in"
msgstr "本网站的语言为"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:172
msgid "Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings."
msgstr "留空则使用 WordPress 设置中的站点语言。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:180
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:748
msgid "Languages to publish"
msgstr "发布语言"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:181
msgid "Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed."
msgstr "每个站点都有自己的网址和网站地图。只发布您希望被索引的语言。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:188
msgid "Translate automatically when I publish or update"
msgstr "发布或更新时自动翻译"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:189
msgid "Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing."
msgstr "编辑页面会将其译文标记为过期，系统将在后台重新生成。编辑但不更改任何字词不会消耗任何费用。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:196
msgid "What gets translated"
msgstr "翻译内容"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:201
msgid "Post types"
msgstr "文章类型"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:209
msgid "Translate the web addresses too"
msgstr "请一并翻译网址"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:210
msgid "French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks."
msgstr "法国访客将被引导至 /fr/a-propos/ 而不是 /fr/about/。未翻译的网址将继续有效并进行重定向，因此任何已被索引的内容都不会失效。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:217
msgid "Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text"
msgstr "翻译 SEO 标题、描述和图片替代文本"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:224
msgid "Translate categories and tags"
msgstr "翻译分类和标签"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:231
msgid "Translate navigation menus"
msgstr "翻译导航菜单"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:238
msgid "Translate WooCommerce products and attributes"
msgstr "翻译 WooCommerce 产品和属性"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:239
msgid "Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched."
msgstr "简短描述、购买备注、属性标签和变体描述。价格、SKU 和存储的选项值绝不会被修改。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:246
msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:251
msgid "Add hreflang tags"
msgstr "添加 hreflang 标签"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:252
msgid "Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it."
msgstr "告诉搜索引擎这些页面是不同语言的相同页面。除非另一个插件已经在处理此功能，否则请保持开启。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:259
msgid "Publish a sitemap for each language"
msgstr "为每种语言发布站点地图"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:266
msgid "Publish llms.txt for each language"
msgstr "为每种语言发布 llms.txt"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:267
msgid "A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap."
msgstr "AI 答案引擎可读取的纯文本网站地图。它们通常无法运行 JavaScript，并且可能永远不会获取站点地图。"

#: includes/class-zinn-translate-admin.php:274
#: includes/class-zinn-translate-switcher.php:135
